# Golden vectors for the X.509 worked example.
#
# Written by OpenSSL rather than by hand or by situ:
#
#   openssl req -x509 -newkey ec -pkeyopt ec_paramgen_curve:prime256v1 -noenc \
#           -keyout /dev/null -outform DER -subj /CN=situ -days 3650
#
# `items` is the same certificate from its fifth byte, past the outer header,
# which `openssl asn1parse` says is four bytes long.

